POST {{ECommerce.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@ecommerce.com",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### ADMIN PRODUCT TEST
POST {{ECommerce.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer  {{token}}

{
  "name": "Admin Test Product",
  "description": "Admin yetki testi",
  "price": 100,
  "stock": 10,
  "imageUrl": "admin-test.jpg",
  "isActive": true,
  "categoryId": 1
}
### ADMIN CATEGORY TEST
POST {{ECommerce.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer  {{token}}

{
  "name": "Elektronik",
  "description": "Elektronik ürünler",
  "isActive": true
}
### ADMIN CATEGORY UPDATE TEST
PUT {{ECommerce.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/categories/3
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer  {{token}}
{
  "id": 3,
  "name": "Elektronik Güncel",
  "description": "Güncellenmiş elektronik ürünler",
  "isActive": true
}
### ADMIN CATEGORY DELETE TEST
DELETE {{ECommerce.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/categories/3
Authorization: Bearer  {{token}}

### CART - ADD ITEM
POST {{ECommerce.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/cart?userId=1&productId=3&quantity=10

### CART - GET USER CART
GET {{ECommerce.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/cart/1

### CART - UPDATE QUANTITY
PUT {{ECommerce.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/cart/3?quantity=5

### CART - REMOVE ITEM
DELETE {{ECommerce.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/cart/2

### ORDER - CREATE ORDER
POST {{ECommerce.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/order/1

### ORDER - GET USER ORDERS
GET {{ECommerce.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/order/user/1

### ORDER - UPDATE STATUS
PUT {{ECommerce.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/order/7/status?status=Cancelled

### ADMIN - GET ALL ORDERS
GET {{ECommerce.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/order/all
Authorization: Bearer  {{token}}

### PAYMENT - CREATE
POST {{ECommerce.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/payment/7?paymentMethod=Card

### PRODUCT - SEARCH
GET {{ECommerce.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/products/search?searchTerm=Admin
Authorization: Bearer  {{token}}


### PRODUCT - FILTER BY CATEGORY
GET {{ECommerce.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/products/category/1
Authorization: Bearer  {{token}}


### PRODUCT - FILTER BY PRICE
GET {{ECommerce.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/products/filter?minPrice=100&maxPrice=500
Authorization: Bearer  {{token}}